00:56:23.910 --> 00:56:30.970
<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our office manager. Adrianne Mathiowetz runs our website.

00:56:30.970 --> 00:56:37.850
<v Ira Glass>Music help today from Damien Graef and Rob Geddis. Mike Birbiglia was recorded at UCB East in Manhattan and Littlefield in Brooklyn.

00:56:37.850 --> 00:56:43.910
