00:56:52.030 --> 00:56:59.370
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, his new plastic surgery is, I don't know. It's just at that awkward phase.

00:56:59.370 --> 00:57:05.290
<v Mike Birbiglia>Where your face doesn't move, but then your eyes pan side to side.

00:57:05.290 --> 00:57:10.290
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
